the obligation that confidentiality obligation forbids the_employee to disclose confidential information by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract confidentiality obligation starts on day N
    and D = N + 1825.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract structural alteration prohibition starts on day the day.

the obligation that structural alteration prohibition forbids the_tenant to make alterations by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract structural alteration prohibition starts on day N
    and D = N + 365.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract debt restriction starts on day the day.

the obligation that debt restriction forbids the_borrower to incur additional debt by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract debt restriction starts on day N
    and D = N + 1095.

the obligation that confidentiality obligation forbids a party to disclose confidential information by day a due day D as its first obligation is met on day a day N if
    the party does disclose confidential information on day N
    and the obligation that confidentiality obligation forbids the party to disclose confidential information by day D as its first obligation starts on day a day M
    and M < N
    and N <= D.

the contract is breached by a party doing what was forbidden on day a day if
    the obligation that confidentiality obligation forbids the party to disclose confidential information by day a due day as its first obligation ends on day the day
    and the party does disclose confidential information on day the day.

the contract is fulfilled if
    the obligation that confidentiality obligation forbids a party to disclose confidential information by day a due day as its first obligation is missed on day a day.

the obligation that confidentiality obligation forbids a party to disclose confidential information by day a due day as its first obligation has deadline day the due day if
