the obligation that structural alteration prohibition forbids a party to make alterations by day a due day D as its first obligation is met on day a day N if
    the party does make alterations with alteration type an alteration type on day N
    and the obligation that structural alteration prohibition forbids the party to make alterations by day D as its first obligation starts on day a day M
    and M < N
    and the alteration type is equal to "structural"
    and N <= D.

